#: content/anniversaries/30/_index.md:76
msgid "[Become a member](#donorboxbox) and build a better world"
msgstr ""

#: content/anniversaries/30/_index.md:78
msgid ""
"By becoming a [Supporting Member](https://ev.kde.org/getinvolved/supporting-"
"members/) **you join an enlightened and altruistic league that really cares "
"for Free Software**. You guarantee its future survival and you don’t only "
"get to use it for yourself, but also provide for others often less fortunate "
"than you."
msgstr ""

#: content/anniversaries/30/_index.md:80
msgid ""
"We are starting out with 1200 members, and we want to reach **1500**<sup>[1]"
"(#pbu)</sup>."
msgstr ""

#: content/anniversaries/30/_index.md:86
msgid ""
"KDE was born in 1996, hence it is symbolically important for us to also "
"reach our stretch goal of **1996 supporting members** before our annual "
"[Akademy](https://akademy.kde.org/2026/) event starts."
msgstr ""

#: content/anniversaries/30/_index.md:88
msgid ""
"As a non-profit, we cannot accumulate wealth. We cannot count on a treasure "
"chest to see us through a rough patch. [Your regular contributions]"
"(#donorboxbox) **keep KDE running no matter what**."
msgstr ""

#: content/anniversaries/30/_index.md:90
msgid ""
"You become a true benefactor, an essential part of our community, "
"facilitating, contributing, and providing. [With regular donations]"
"(#donorboxbox) **you can truly say \"I helped\"**."
msgstr ""

#: content/anniversaries/30/_index.md:92
msgid ""
"To best express our gratitude for [your support](#donorboxbox), we would "
"like to include you on the list of people who help us routinely keep KDE "
"alive. If you would prefer to remain anonymous, that’s fine too of course. "
"But, if you would like to join our **Hall of Benefactors**, we will post "
"your name/nickname here shortly and also include it in the welcome slideshow "
"on Plasma 6.8<sup>[2](#p68)</sup>."
msgstr ""

#: content/anniversaries/30/_index.md:95
msgid ""
"<p class=\"annotation\" id=\"pbu\"><sup>1</sup> The progress bar updates "
"daily and, when we reach our first goal, it will reveal a full rainbow🌈</p>\n"
msgstr ""

#: content/anniversaries/30/_index.md:97
msgid ""
"<p class=\"annotation\" id=\"p68\"><sup>2</sup> Plasma 6.8 will be released "
"in October, just in time for KDE’s official birthday.</p>\n"
msgstr ""

#: content/anniversaries/30/_index.md:99
msgid "Help KDE…"
msgstr ""

#: content/anniversaries/30/_index.md:101
msgid ""
"Most of our funds (70%!) come from private end users just like you. Become a "
"**Supporting Member** and help ensure we receive a regular amount of money "
"we can count on. This helps us plan and know what to expect for the next "
"month, quarter, or year."
msgstr ""

#: content/anniversaries/30/_index.md:103
msgid ""
"[Use the box at the top of this page](#donorboxbox) and select *Become a "
"Member* to become a Supporting Member."
msgstr ""

#: content/anniversaries/30/_index.md:105
msgid ""
"Or make a **one-time donation** and provide us with emergency funds to get "
"us through the following year."
msgstr ""

#: content/anniversaries/30/_index.md:107
msgid ""
"[Use the box at the top of this page](#donorboxbox) and select *1-time "
"Donation* to make your donation."
msgstr ""

#: content/anniversaries/30/_index.md:109
#, fuzzy
#| msgid "Donate"
msgid "Why donate"
msgstr "Doni"

#: content/anniversaries/30/_index.md:111
#: content/anniversaries/30/_index.md:127
#: content/anniversaries/30/_index.md:167
msgid "<div class=\"donation_reasons\">\n"
msgstr ""

#: content/anniversaries/30/_index.md:113
msgid ""
"**We produce first-class software** and [your donation](#top) keeps us “in "
"business” and our software sustainable for generations to come."
msgstr ""

#: content/anniversaries/30/_index.md:115
msgid "![](/fundraisers/yearend2025/Katie_Konqi_make_software.png)"
msgstr ""

#: content/anniversaries/30/_index.md:117
msgid ""
"**We keep you in control** and [your donation](#top) allows KDE to remain "
"truly independent."
msgstr ""

#: content/anniversaries/30/_index.md:118
msgid ""
"**We reach people the tech industry left behind** and [your donation](#top) "
"contributes to serving those who are ignored by the industry, and bring "
"marginalized users into the community so we can grow the project for "
"everyone."
msgstr ""

#: content/anniversaries/30/_index.md:119
msgid ""
"**We push to get Free Software into public institutions** and [your donation]"
"(#top) helps us adapt our software to what public institutions require, so "
"your taxes go to fund Free Software, not some big tech corp."
msgstr ""

