#: content/anniversaries/30/anniversary_events.md:0
msgid ""
"In 1997, about 15 KDE developers met in Arnsberg, Germany, to work on the "
"project and discuss its future. This event became known as [KDE One](https://"
"community.kde.org/KDE_Project_History/KDE_One_(Developer_Meeting))."
msgstr ""

