msgid ""
"In April 1999, a dragon is announced as the new animated assistant to the "
"KDE Help Center. It was so charming that it replaced the previous project "
"mascot, Kandalf, from version 3.x on. See the [KDE 2 Screenshot](https://"
"timeline.kde.org/images/kde2b3_5.png) showing Konqi and Kandalf."
