"\"https://timeline.kde.org/images/kde-one-arnsberg.png\" caption: Cornelius "
"Schumacher's Archive content: >- In 1997, about 15 KDE developers met in "
"Arnsberg, Germany, to work on the project and discuss its future. This event "
"became known as [KDE One](https://community.kde.org/KDE_Project_History/"
"KDE_One_(Developer_Meeting))."
