"images/kde4.jpg\" caption: KDE 4.0 content: >- In 2008, the community "
"[announced the revolutionary KDE 4](https://kde.org/announcements/4/4.0/). "
"In addition to the visual impact of the new default theme, Oxygen, and the "
"new desktop interface, Plasma, KDE 4 also innovated by presenting the "
"following applications: the PDF reader Okular, the Dolphin file manager, as "
"well as KWin, supporting graphics effects. See the [KDE 4.0 Visual Guide]"
"(https://kde.org/announcements/4/4.0/guide/)."
