"of Plasma 5. This new generation of Plasma had a new theme, Breeze. Changes "
"included a migration to a new, fully hardware-accelerated graphics stack "
"centered around an OpenGL(ES) scenegraph. This version of Plasma used as a "
"base Qt 5 and Frameworks 5."
