"    <p class=\"text-left\">KDE supports the FEEP and BE4FOSS programs to "
"help free and open-source communities produce more environmentally friendly "
"software. The projects provide communities with guidelines and support to "
"optimize software to be more energy efficient and have a longer life-span.</"
