#: content/support/_index.md:0
msgid ""
"If your [troubleshooting](https://community.kde.org/Troubleshooting) has "
"pointed to a bug in KDE software, [learn how to report it here](https://"
"community.kde.org/Get_Involved/Issue_Reporting). If you’re not sure that the "
"issue is in fact a bug, [discuss it on the forum](https://discuss.kde.org) "
"first, and others can help you determine that."
msgstr ""

#: content/support/_index.md:40
#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
